    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14707" root="رتك" body-key="r">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ارتكهُ</span></b>  <i>He made him</i> (namely, a camel,) <i>to go in
the manner expl. above:</i> (S, K:) or <i>made him to go
a quick pace.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ارتك الضَّحِكَ</span> (assumed tropical:)  <i>He
laughed languidly:</i> (K:) and so <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْتَأَ الضَّحِكَ</span>.
(TA.)

